        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "A mixture of Dy(NO3)3·6H2O (0.0456 g, 0.1 mmol), HL (0.0243 g, 0.1 mmol), NaOH (0.008 g, 0.2 mmol), MeOH (2 mL), and DMF (0.5 mL) was sealed in a Pyrex-tube (8 mL) and heated for 12 h at 100 °C. After cooling to room temperature, red crystals of 1 were obtained.",
